      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Reviewed latest knowledge-usage alongside the full positive and unsuccessful token/scorer/value/pool/summary/family trajectories. Its executed r0027 family ablations do not establish INFNet transfer or original-method superiority. Re-read the card and pinned benchmark forward; retained task masks are another explicit feedback channel.",
