        "pool_ordinal_task",
        "pool_match_shared",
        "pool_ordinal_shared"
      ],
      "nearest_work_difference": "No learned hubs, gated broadcasts or stacked token interaction added. These are conditional action-coordinate path interventions in the incumbent. The original INFNet paper/author-code equivalence and priority remain unverified.",
